stance — third-party credits

The clipboard shelf (`stance clip`) is inspired by ClipBoardLine by @orkunisitmak
(MIT, https://github.com/orkunisitmak/clipboardline). No code was
copied; stance reimplements the ideas for Hyprland.

Built-in theme palettes follow these projects (all MIT licensed):
Catppuccin (catppuccin/catppuccin), Nord (nordtheme/nord), Gruvbox
(morhetz/gruvbox), Dracula (dracula/dracula-theme), Tokyo Night
(enkia/tokyo-night-vscode-theme), Rosé Pine (rose-pine/rose-pine-theme),
Everforest (sainnhe/everforest), Kanagawa (rebelot/kanagawa.nvim), One Dark
(atom/one-dark-syntax), Solarized (altercation/solarized). Colour values are
facts; the theme names belong to their projects.
